    <item>
      <title>定义下一代AI的思考边界：字节Seed-OSS的超长上下文与“思考预算”革命</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/aiseed-oss-20250821121004745-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 21 Aug 2025 12:10:04 +0800</pubDate>
